        "body": "fix: deploy reports dashboard + untrack stray artifact (#35)\n\nTwo cleanups:\n\n1. **The reports dashboard never shipped.** The `.gitignore` pattern\n`reports/` (added for CI report artifacts) also matched\n`public/reports/`, so the dashboard HTML was silently excluded from the\nDeep Field PR and the live site 404s at `/tuples/reports/`. Anchored the\npattern to the repo root (`/reports/`) and committed the dashboard.\n2. Untrack `test-results/.last-run.json` (directory is gitignored;\ntracked file overrode it).\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
